  "gui.grindless.guide.bootstrap.title": "Bootstrap",
  "gui.grindless.guide.bootstrap.body": "Start with ordinary wood, stone, glass, redstone and copper, plus exactly two iron for Grindless machinery. The Multitool is cobblestone and sticks: it turns a Grindless block, and it does not mine. Spend one iron on the Hand Crank Dynamo and one on the Crude Extractor. Power the extractor at least once. A Data Core is cobble and redstone; the Research Terminal calibrates one at F0 into a physical component.",
  "gui.grindless.guide.voltaic.title": "Voltaic",
  "gui.grindless.guide.voltaic.body": "Two glass, two copper, two redstone and a Calibrated Data Core, not a world permission, make four Relay Matrices. That is the Bootstrap exit and starts the Voltaic factory: the Arc Furnace, Pulverizer, Thermal Generator, Flux Pylon and belts. A cobblestone generator can feed the Pulverizer for renewable sand; the Arc Furnace vitrifies it into renewable glass. The same sand is silica for silicon. The Process Atlas lists the live recipes. It does not solve a line.",
  "gui.grindless.guide.contact.title": "Contact",
  "gui.grindless.guide.contact.body": "Advanced Data Cores are physical components made from a Data Core and iron plates. The Chemical Reactor is manufactured, not hand-crafted: one casing, two motors and four plates. A vanadia pellet and held air turn sulfur dioxide into sulfur trioxide, then acid. Pickle spends that acid on an iron plate. That is the contact process.",
  "gui.grindless.guide.metals.title": "Metals",
  "gui.grindless.guide.metals.body": "The Arc Furnace turns ten iron ingots and one carbon into ten steel ingots. Carbon is coal. One slag becomes one refractory brick. Sand or nether quartz, with two carbon, becomes metallurgical silicon, and ten of those become seven electronic silicon. The furnace still holds 1500 °C. An off-band run costs time, never yield."
}
